{
  "title": "Sources in, video out",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "title": "Five stages, one diagram",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": [
            "You give a language model three PDFs and ask for an animated explainer.",
            "How could you check every picture renders and every sentence traces to a page?",
            "And that each visual lands exactly when the voice does?"
          ],
          "visual": {
            "type": "title",
            "title": "Sources in, video out",
            "subtitle": "renders? traced? in sync?"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": [
            "Follow one page: page 6 of your notes.",
            "Ingest makes it one chunk, id notes p6, in chunks.json.",
            "Plain text is cut every 2,500 characters."
          ],
          "visual": {
            "type": "diagram",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "pdf",
                "label": "notes.pdf p6",
                "col": 0,
                "row": 1,
                "shape": "box"
              },
              {
                "id": "chunks",
                "label": "chunks.json",
                "col": 1,
                "row": 1,
                "shape": "stack"
              }
            ],
            "edges": [
              {
                "id": "e1",
                "from": "pdf",
                "to": "chunks",
                "label": "ingest"
              }
            ],
            "steps": [
              {
                "show": [
                  "pdf"
                ]
              },
              {
                "show": [
                  "chunks",
                  "e1"
                ],
                "relabel": [
                  {
                    "id": "chunks",
                    "label": "notes:p6"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "highlight": [
                  "chunks"
                ],
                "relabel": [
                  {
                    "id": "chunks",
                    "label": "chunks.json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "cite": [
            "readme:s1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "say": [
            "Next, the model writes chapters of claims into outline.json.",
            "Each claim must cite a real chunk id, like notes p6."
